description:
Nat Adderley Quintet - I Married an Angel (1955)

Personnel: Nat Adderley (cornet), Jerome Richardson (tenor sax), Hank Jones (piano), Wendell Marshall (bass), Kenny Clarke (drums)

from the album 'THAT'S NAT' (Savoy Records)

Ron Crotty Trio - Ginza (aka Ginza Samba) (1955)

Personnel: Eddie Duran (guitar), Vince Guaraldi (piano), Ron Crotty (bass) 

from the album 'MODERN MUSIC FROM SAN FRANCISCO' (Fantasy Records)

Ron Crotty Trio - The Night We Called It a Day (1955)

Personnel: Eddie Duran (guitar), Vince Guaraldi (celesta), Ron Crotty (bass) 

from the album 'MODERN MUSIC FROM SAN FRANCISCO' (Fantasy Records)
